<task id="005" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Complete 11 of 14 null AppRoleId GUIDs in Infrastructure/Auth/GraphAppRoles.cs via az enumeration</title>
    <phase>A Doc Consolidation + Audits</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies BFF code file (src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Auth/GraphAppRoles.cs); tag includes bff-api + auth. Per root CLAUDE.md §8 rigor table, bff-api + auth tags = FULL. Wrong GUID silently fails T3 (Graph app-role parity) at H10 — high blast radius per plan.md § High-Risk Items.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Mechanical GUID population with az CLI evidence; a clear canonical constant (r3 task 062 landed the file); no novel algorithm. Per Step 3.5.5b: single-component code implementation with explicit reference = sonnet.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Serial per-GUID commit discipline: each of 10 GUIDs commits in isolation with az output cited (plan.md § High-Risk Items). Parallel dispatch would race on the same file.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>none</deps>
    <tags>bff-api, auth</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-6 hours</estimated-effort>
