  <prompt>
Complete the 11 of 14 null AppRoleId GUIDs in src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Auth/GraphAppRoles.cs (spec/design says "10 of 14" but actual count verified by discovery is 11 — see notes/resource-discovery-2026-08-16.md §12; only 3 GUIDs populated: `IdUserReadWriteAll`, `IdGroupMemberReadWriteAll`, `IdDirectoryReadWriteAll` at lines 152/154/156). For each null AppRoleId, enumerate the corresponding Microsoft Graph resource service-principal via `az ad sp show --id 00000003-0000-0000-c000-000000000000` (Graph) or `az ad sp show --id 00000007-0000-0000-c000-000000000000` (Dynamics), extract the exact appRole GUID matching the constant's role name, and populate it. Commit each GUID in an isolated small commit with the az output cited in the commit message. This is the H10 escalation gate — MUST complete before first production customer provisioning (spec MUST rules). At completion, ALSO reconcile spec.md FR-06/Prerequisites/SC #16b + design.md §4.1 H10 + CLAUDE.md § Applicable ADRs to say "11 of 14 null" (was incorrectly stated as "10 of 14").
  </prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform BFF developer with expertise in Microsoft Graph app-only auth, Azure CLI (az ad sp show), and the r3-landed GraphAppRoles.cs constant surface. Follow ADR-028 (Spaarke Auth v2) + CLAUDE.md §10 BFF Hygiene strictly.</role>

  <goal>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Auth/GraphAppRoles.cs contains all 14 AppRoleId GUIDs populated (11 previously-null now filled); each of the 11 fills lives in its own isolated commit with the exact az CLI invocation + output snippet quoted in the commit message; dotnet build succeeds with zero new warnings (net10 analyzers-as-errors per NFR-06); the BFF publish size delta is reported in the PR description (NFR-01); spec.md/design.md/CLAUDE.md references to "10 of 14 null" reconciled to "11 of 14 null" via follow-up doc PR.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>
Per spec.md FR-13 + Phase A escalation gate + design.md §7 + notes/r3-handoff.md. r3 task 062 landed the GraphAppRoles.cs constant surface (14 role names) but left 11 AppRoleId GUIDs null pending az enumeration (discovery report notes/resource-discovery-2026-08-16.md §12 verified actual count = 11, not 10 as claimed in spec/design/CLAUDE.md). H10 handler (Wave C4) grants Graph app-roles from this constant onto the UAMI SP — a null GUID silently fails T3 (parity check) and produces app-only Graph 403s in production. Owner directive: complete in Phase A r1 (spec.md § Unresolved Questions resolved to "r1 owns" per plan.md).
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Auth/GraphAppRoles.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">projects/customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1/notes/r3-handoff.md</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">.claude/adr/ADR-028-spaarke-auth-architecture.md</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">.claude/constraints/auth.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="none" status="complete">Phase A is startable; r3 task 062 landed on master (`be3f12bb6`)</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="spec.md">SCOPE: This task modifies ONLY src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Auth/GraphAppRoles.cs. Do NOT refactor auth code, do NOT change the constant surface shape, do NOT add new roles.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md">SCOPE: Each of the 10 GUID fills MUST be an isolated commit with the exact `az ad sp show` invocation + relevant output line quoted in the commit message. A single "populate all 10" commit is a defect (per plan.md § High-Risk Items).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">SCOPE: The 14 role IDs are the Graph + Dynamics app-role surface Spaarke's BFF uses; no other constant may be introduced. Follow ADR-028 21-MUST rules for auth ceremony.</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md-§10">SCOPE: BFF-touching task — load .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md; report BFF publish size + delta in PR description per NFR-01 (baseline 44.96 MB incl. PDBs on net10 per r3 handoff).</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-06">SCOPE: Analyzers-as-errors — zero new warnings; CS8601/CS8604 nullable are errors. `dotnet build` MUST succeed on net10 baseline.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: For each populated GUID, verify against the OFFICIAL Microsoft Graph app-role catalog (via az) — do NOT hand-type GUIDs from documentation snippets. Blindly-typed GUIDs are the T3 failure mode per plan.md.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>Microsoft Graph app-only auth + BFF Hygiene</topic>
    <files>
